WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.690
- Did you not hear that I
ruined Christmas recently?

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.880
- Oh, yeah, you did ruin Christmas!

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.540
- I was like, how did I mess that up?

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.080
- You guys are such, I know, I know.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.610
Sharon Osborne, man, she
hates you guys. (laughs)

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.600
- She was just on my show!

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.070
And I was like, wait, what?

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.850
I was like, people got
so mad 'cause we changed.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.870
He had this idea because
of the MeToo movement.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:24.260
The pulled "Baby, It's Cold
Outside" from any radio.

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.010
Like, a lot of radio
stations at Christmas.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:26.930
Well, I love that song.

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.400
- Well, yeah, but then Sharon assumed

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.080
that you guys burned them all
in the backyard or something.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:33.330
They can never listen to
the original ever again.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.000
- And both John and I have actually

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.610
cut "Baby, It's Cold
Outside," the original,

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:37.590
and we like the original,

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.570
but we notice that a lot of people didn't,

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.403
and so we were like, oh,

00:00:40.403 --> 00:00:41.880
let's just give 'em
another option or whatever,

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.238
and apparently, we killed Christmas.

00:00:45.238 --> 00:00:46.690
(audience laughs)
- You guys killed Christmas.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.610
- I mean, I literally
woke up the next day,

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.400
and I was like, what?
- If I can't have

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.560
my creepy song,

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:53.541
it's not Christmas.

00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:55.290
- I want the date rape dream.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:58.710
- I want date-rapey songs.

00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.580
- I was like, and honestly,

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.440
the original doesn't even offend me.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.344
I just was like, cool,
we'll do another version.

00:01:03.344 --> 00:01:06.790
- Exactly, like, I'm not offendable.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.133
Like, I hear it all.

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:10.000
It's hard to offend me.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.810
I wasn't mad about the song.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.387
I don't care what you guys do.

00:01:13.387 --> 00:01:15.500
But to be like, ooh!

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.430
I hate this now!

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:18.920
Oh my God, get over it.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.400
- Yeah, it's so weird.
(audience laughs)

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:22.530
- Go on, Sharon.

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:23.540
- Go (laughs).
(audience laughs)

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.280
I love Sharon.

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.670
No, but here's the thing.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.680
She actually said, and she
means it, like, she loves y'all.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.130
That's why I thought
it was so weird, like,

00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:32.730
she took it so personal.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.310
I just thought it was weird.

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:35.370
But here's the thing.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.700
I actually love her.
(audience laughing)

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:37.820
I do.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.610
She came on here, and
I was like, I love her.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.020
I think she's so funny,

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:43.620
but then I was like, we
didn't kill Christmas.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:44.887
- You're nicer than me, man.

00:01:44.887 --> 00:01:45.720
(audience laughs)

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.400
- Well, 'cause I'm
trying to understand it,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.930
because I'm like, there are so many issues

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:50.408
in the world right now.

00:01:50.408 --> 00:01:51.429
- No!

00:01:51.429 --> 00:01:54.228
I want my creepy song!

00:01:54.228 --> 00:01:55.700
(audience laughs)

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.300
- [Kelly] It's so weird. Anyway.

